Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:54:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] octet: fix test rewrite (leave mixed-case invalid vectors
 alone); fixture mock time after Octet genesis

The previous address rewrite lowercased deliberately mixed-case bech32 vectors,
making them valid. Re-done skipping mixed-case tokens. The unit test fixture
clock was 2020-08-31, before the new genesis, so mined blocks were 'time-too-new';
moved to 2026-11-06.
---
 src/test/data/key_io_invalid.json      | 4 ++--
 src/test/util/setup_common.h           | 2 +-
 test/functional/rpc_validateaddress.py | 6 +++---
 3 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

